Feature: MA Trend Filter with ATR Stop
  Primary timeframe: 1h
  Parameter ema_period default 50

  # Demonstrates the 0.52 increments end-to-end:
  #  - INC1 MA trend filter: price_crosses_above_ema / price_crosses_below_ema
  #  - INC2 ATR dynamic stop: a stop frozen at the entry fill, 2x the ATR(14)
  #    below entry (entry_price - 2 * atr_value(14)).

  Scenario: Enter long when price reclaims the EMA
    Given no open position
    When price_crosses_above_ema(ema_period)
    Then long_entry
    And with stop_loss at entry_price - 2 * atr_value(14)

  Scenario: Exit long when price loses the EMA
    Given a long position is open
    When price_crosses_below_ema(ema_period)
    Then long_exit
